ind":"announcement","title":"Zeno Survivor — Developer Letter #01","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the Zeno Survivor demo! Zeno Survivor combines survival crafting with RPG elements. When it comes to survival, however, we know that some players may find the experience rather unforgiving. One of our core design philosophies is to avoid overwhelming players with explanations or hand-holding at the start. Instead, we want you to discover your own ways to survive. This of course comes with the trade off that some players may feel a little lost at first, and se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:01:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043906","verified_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5105370-1847286114028177","game_id":"steam-5105370","kind":"announcement","title":"Zeno Survivor is taking part in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Survivors, welcome to the world of Zeno Survivor! This is Alim’s Survivor Support Division. Whether you’ve just discovered Zeno Survivor or have already ventured into this world, thank you so much for joining us!Zeno Survivor is taking part in Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition. Explore a post-apocalyptic world brought to life through pixel art and 3D in this single-player survival RPG.If you haven’t visited this world yet, try living through the first seven in-game days in the demo. Your fir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:30:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028177","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5105370-1846651706673397","game_id":"steam-5105370","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Notice (ver0.1.1)","summary":"Dear Survivors, Thank you for playing the Zeno Survivor demo. Today, we have updated the demo to ver. 0.1.1. Please see the patch notes below for more details. Patch Notes Added a save system. Your progress will be automatically saved at the following times: 1. When you select \"Return to Title\" from the System Menu. 2. At regular intervals. 3. When certain conditions are met. Automatically saved data can be loaded by selecting \"Continue\" on the title screen. *Important Notes Starting a new game ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:16:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673397","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5105370-1846018067928610","game_id":"steam-5105370","kind":"announcement","title":"The Zeno Survivor Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"Hello, survivors! It’s a pleasure to meet you! The Zeno Survivor demo is now available to play! Zeno Survivor is a single-player survival RPG where you explore a post-apocalyptic world brought to life through a unique combination of pixel art and 3D. What sights and experiences await you in this beautiful yet dangerous world? Step into it and discover them for yourself! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46279368/0c4f3689ad7d8e56a2568399fbb851a2a4e9f8c8.png ★ About the Demo The demo lets you play through seven ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:22:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5105370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5105370":"2026-10-26T08:22